#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:3
#: 2e035971d8224109963bf00ab33fcfa7
msgid "折返螺旋（Folded Helix）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:5
#: f87121f702f4426ea0d237061cbc3634
msgid "`Group`: `Magnetism` | `Class`: `FoldedHelixCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:7
#: 8868239b6a974097881addf549027921
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:9
#: e8fa9b0936934365b66179deef9706e2
msgid ""
"按层离散定义对称折返螺旋磁矩纹理。磁矩被限制在垂直于 `plane_normal` 的平面内，沿 `layer_axis` "
"方向在前半周期逐层按固定角度旋转、到转折层后按相同步长反向旋转，形成一个\"先顺时针、到中间再逆时针\"的三角相位轮廓。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:11
#: d07a2021100d4e0399a220de4ae494a9
#, python-brace-format
msgid "s(k)=\\begin{cases}k,&0\\le k\\le h\\\\2h-k,&h\\lt k\\lt2h\\end{cases}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:13
#: e77e8aa450a74f1798ce303c7884dc19
msgid "\\phi(k)=\\phi_0+\\sigma\\cdot s(k)\\cdot\\Delta\\phi"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:15
#: 0d384bd491544543ad10bff2e06a54ad
msgid "默认 `half_period_mode = Auto from layer count`，会在当前层范围上自动构造首尾闭合的折返周期。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:17
#: fc184578dc5f456897635974571d46fd
msgid ""
"**和 `Spin Spiral` 的区别：** `Spin Spiral` "
"沿传播轴连续旋转（单向、不折返）。本卡生成的是\"走一段、折回来\"的分层离散纹理，更适合二维磁体、异质结界面或需要镜像对称磁矩分布的场景。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:19
#: 9bfd5812b21f4fcd8b79bc6e9dcc79b5
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:21
#: af42d14d88fc4b36ba3134e518ab875b
msgid "场景：层状反铁磁模型在非均匀自旋纹理上预测崩塌"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:23
#: 49e767a1e05b4d4490d32368d1e2e790
msgid ""
"你训练了一个层状磁性模型（如 CrI3 双层），训练数据里层内是 FM、层间是 AFM——这是完美均匀的磁序。但实验发现施加电场后，顶层磁矩偏了 "
"15 度而底层偏了 -15 度——这是一个非单调的、分层的自旋纹理。模型对此完全无法预测。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:25
#: 9f40b0e6a03c449280b79795c56b0d64
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** "
"训练集里的自旋变化是单调的（要么全同向、要么交替翻转）。模型从未见过磁矩方向在空间中\"先转过去、再转回来\"的纹理。需要生成按层离散的折返螺旋构型，让模型学习分层磁矩分布的能量面。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:27
#: 56a46a580a7a4762a229b9273e91851a
msgid ""
"**输入：** 一个已有 `initial_magmoms` 的层状磁性结构（或通过 `magnitude_source = "
"Map/default magnitude` 指定磁矩模长）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:29
#: 0fb307eefc384c66bad282fe8b06d971
msgid ""
"**目标：** 用 auto 模式自动适配当前层数，生成 3 个层间转角（15/30/45 度）、4 个全局相位（0/30/60/90 度）、2 "
"种手性顺序，共 3x4x2 = 24 个折返螺旋构型"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:31
#: 6f5c878c175448dda0ef8784416147fa
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:32
#: 4ac57b2055da4eb990402848412d48d5
msgid "`Layer Axis` = `[0, 0, 1]`（沿 z 轴分层）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:33
#: 016cbb7e6d3c4b02b2f96d57a6b2c435
msgid "`Plane Normal` = `[0, 0, 1]`（磁矩在 xy 面内旋转）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:34
#: e7bbd349dc814107a3b488da0a24cbbe
msgid "`Half-Period Mode` = `Auto from layer count`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:35
#: 55d30794244e46129347f72d2eec3969
msgid "`Angle Step Range` = `[15, 45, 15]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:36
#: 632ee5e841ec4e22a105c79d1fffbaf3
msgid "`Phase Range` = `[0, 90, 30]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:37
#: 5649fa92c4f8490aa494a7777cf8e74a
msgid "`Sequence` = `Both`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:39
#: c6a2595836af443e93b247464dc67885
msgid ""
"**输出：** 24 个结构，磁矩在 xy 面内按层折返旋转，带 "
"`FoldedHelix(h=...,da=...,ph=...,seq=...,ax=...,pn=...)` 标签。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:41
#: e18f307fcdb24d0485e6c5c65e0ccfb0
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:42
#: d3edb5f0e7174198909c6abd3bb441c4
msgid "重训后跑几组不同层间转角的测试构型，能量排序应合理（近 FM 的转角能量低，近 180 度的高）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:43
#: 9aa6885ac149493ca7d38062c3df0962
msgid "抽查输出：层 0 磁矩方向 = 全局相位，中间层达到最大转角，顶层回到接近全局相位"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:44
#: 04e99a6957de45b2ba265ee77a87636c
msgid ""
"如果 auto 模式给出的半周期不合适——比如你的结构有 10 层但 auto 给了 h=4——切到 manual 模式手动指定 "
"`half_period_layers`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:46
