#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:49
#: 96cbfaa2c5aa4453860c78ada1232f0f
msgid "层状磁体（vdW 磁体、异质结、超晶格）需要非单调的分层磁矩纹理"
